n leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌确认新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练阶段，有望远早于年底发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind负责人科拉伊·卡武克奥卢在AI Agenda Live峰会上确认，新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练初期阶段，有望远早于年底推出。谷歌已跳过此前传闻的Gemini 3.5 Pro，将研发重心全面转向Gemini 4。目前，该模型正处于防护机制开发与安全测试阶段，谷歌工程师已在内部将其应用于Antigravity AI编程工具。卡武克奥卢表示，团队对Gemini 4的早期测试结果感到振奋，未来将保持快速迭代。此次调整反映了谷歌在经历Gemini 3.1及Flash系列模型发布后的战略重心转移，即通过集中资源研发下一代旗舰，以巩固其在LLM领域的技术前沿地位。对于行业关注的AGI议题，谷歌更倾向于聚焦构建可信赖的智能体。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a4bff8a49fa33f8572fdc481f881ca00.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 24, 202623智元把具身智能的产能刻度又往前推了一大格。9月24日，第20000台通用具身智能机器人远征A3Ultra在横琴长隆飞船乐园正式走下产线，并当场交到长隆集团手里。从今年3月跨过万台门槛到如今的两万台，这家公司只用了约6个月——产能爬坡的曲线，已经明显进入了加速段。同一天，由智元与长隆联手打造的全球首个大规模具身智能主题乐园在横琴长隆飞船乐园启幕，超过300台智元全系机器人开始在园区里常态化上岗，扎进游客互动、导览、演艺和科普研学等场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT移动端上线语音智能体功能，支持语音指令执行文档与邮件处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd51c491a1a376446f6771e9bdc289bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式在ChatGPT移动端推出基于语音的智能体功能，旨在将语音交互从简单的问答模式升级为端到端的任务执行。Pro和Plus订阅用户现可通过语音指令直接创建文档、撰写电子邮件、总结Slack消息，并支持创建网站、制作PPT及调用云端浏览器等进阶操作。Free和Go订阅用户则可通过插件连接应用实现相关功能。此次更新强化了ChatGPT的跨平台协作能力，Plus用户可在手机端处理任务后无缝切换至电脑端继续工作，并支持在文本与语音输出间灵活切换。这一升级标志着ChatGPT在移动端生产力场景的深度落地，通过语音交互直接驱动复杂任务处理，显著提升了用户在移动环境下的办公效率。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta Connect发布会：Muse接入AI眼镜并推出多款智能硬件设备</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0596dd329feb9582c2f0b2e7dba946d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在Connect大会上发布多款AI硬件，核心智能体Muse全面接入智能眼镜。新款Ray-Ban Meta Audio Glasses（无摄像头版）起售价349美元，续航达12小时；Ray-Ban Meta（Gen 3）起售价449美元，搭载1200万像素摄像头。此外，Meta预告了重100克的轻量级VR眼镜，预计2027年春季上市，售价1299美元起；独立终端Muse Charm将于年底前推出。软件层面，Muse已支持通过语音指令指导健身、购物及环境识别，并拥有专属邮箱，Mac端App可实现计算机任务操作。Meta计划通过交易收取费用实现商业化，并为眼镜新增听力增强功能。截至9月21日，Muse已登顶美区App Store与Google Play免费榜，Meta市值达1.9万亿美元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek年化收入突破10亿美元，拟募资500亿元冲刺上交所上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/58f6242907fbe1a7a1c35a2eb3f7b308.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国内大模型公司DeepSeek年化收入已突破10亿美元，较数月前不足5亿美元的水平实现翻倍增长。DeepSeek首席执行官梁文峰在投资者会议上披露，该业绩增长主要源于产品定价上调及开发者与企业端模型采用率的持续攀升。目前，DeepSeek正处于第二轮融资的关键期，计划在10月底前完成500亿元人民币的募资，投后估值预计达到5000亿元人民币，并正紧锣密鼓筹备在上海证券交易所上市。在生成式AI商业化面临盈利审视的背景下，DeepSeek此次融资规模与估值预期均创下国内大模型初创企业一级市场新纪录。这一进展不仅验证了其大模型技术的商业落地能力，也为本土AI企业冲刺公开资本市场提供了重要风向标，显示出资本市场对头部大模型厂商商业化前景的认可。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
